{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26251","headline":"宫人入道 · 殷尧藩","name":"宫人入道","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"卸却宫妆锦绣衣，黄冠素服制相宜。\n锡名近奉君王旨，佩籙新参老氏师。\n白昼无情趋玉陛，清宵有梦步瑶池。\n绿鬟女伴含愁别，释尽当年妬宠私。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"殷尧藩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26251.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26251","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}